{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":491223,"name":"Grzesiek Zawłodzki","username":"Grzesiek_Zawlodzki","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/grzesiek_zawlodzki/{size}/120876_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T20:24:09.805Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct: Grok Bot / Routines (webhook trigger)\u003cbr\u003e\nBot: Reader Brief\u003cbr\u003e\nRoutine: readwise-reader-brief (trigger: “When a webhook fires”)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot creates a webhook routine successfully, but the routine detail panel never shows the Webhook URL or Webhook key (sender key) fields, so the URL/key cannot be copied into an external service (Readwise custom webhook).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Grok Bot chat, ask the agent to create a routine with trigger { “type”: “webhook” } (e.g. name readwise-reader-brief, enabled).\u003cbr\u003e\nConfirm the routine appears under the agent’s Routines list as “When a webhook fires.”\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen the routine detail panel (agent name in chat header → Routines → readwise-reader-brief).\u003cbr\u003e\nAlso try the deep links from the agent’s Current routines line: Webhook URL / Webhook key / Authorization header (grokbot://app/v1/sidebar?target=webhook-url|webhook-key|webhook-header\u0026amp;automation=readwise-reader-brief).\u003cbr\u003e\nRetry after pause/resume, delete+recreate, and create-as-paused then enable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe routine panel exposes copyable Webhook URL and Webhook key (and Authorization header if applicable) so an external system can POST to the routine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/e/e/ee0e4a581d5654d62e9c888824af7cb18e4293dc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/xXWfOj3k8IAG1fmQ39QCMdvto8A.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"CleanShot 2026-09-14 at 22.22.21@2x.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee0e4a581d5654d62e9c888824af7cb18e4293dc_2_690x485.jpeg\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-09-14 at 22.22.21@2x.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"xXWfOj3k8IAG1fmQ39QCMdvto8A\" width=\"690\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee0e4a581d5654d62e9c888824af7cb18e4293dc_2_690x485.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee0e4a581d5654d62e9c888824af7cb18e4293dc_2_1035x727.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/e/ee0e4a581d5654d62e9c888824af7cb18e4293dc_2_1380x970.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C3CDD2\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eCleanShot 2026-09-14 at 22.22.21@2x.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e3314×2330 1.1 MB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.51.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActual: Panel shows Name, Instruction, “When a webhook fires,” and empty run history — but no URL/key fields under the webhook trigger. Deep links do not surface usable values. The agent cannot read or print the URL/key (by design: credentials stay in the panel only).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso: empty Routines list has no “+” to add a routine manually (expected for server-managed bot routines; creation via chat works). That is separate from the missing webhook credential fields.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImpact: cannot connect Readwise (or any) custom webhook to the routine. Forced workaround: paste Reader doc links / IDs in chat for one-off briefs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn-app Send Feedback was attempted from the agent but failed (“unavailable in privacy mode”); user may also file via Help → Send Feedback.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491223-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491223-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T20:24:19.784Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":15.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171664,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-webhook-routine-has-no-webhook-url-key-fields-in-the-panel","display_username":"Grzesiek Zawłodzki","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137791,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-webhook-routine-has-no-webhook-url-key-fields-in-the-panel/171664/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false}],"stream":[491223]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":376,"name":"automations","slug":"automations"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot: webhook routine has no Webhook URL / key fields in the panel","id":171664,"title":"Grok Bot: webhook routine has no Webhook URL / key fields in the panel","posts_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-14T20:24:09.778Z","views":16,"reply_count":0,"like_count":0,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-14T20:24:09.805Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grok-bot-webhook-routine-has-n